e path, or relative to where this server runs (usually your project); made if missing"}},"required":["run_id"],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"title":"Run package","readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"leaderboard","title":"Leaderboard","description":"The leaderboard (on the public dataset during the hackathon) with each entry's cost × time and the Pareto front, your team's rank and the gap to the next rank. compare_run: where one of your runs would rank if it were your team's entry. Ranking: eligible first, then quality, then LLM cost × run time.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"challenge":{"type":"string","description":"The challenge id; the platform's default when left out"},"limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100,"description":"How many entries (default 10)"},"compare_run":{"type":"string","description":"One of your runs to place on the board. A run id (run_...) from list_runs, a test run id (reh_...), or a submission id (sub_...: its latest run)"}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"title":"Leaderboard","readOnlyHint":true,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"models","title":"Free models","description":"The models the organizers host for free, whether each is up, and how to call them from your computer through `atira models proxy` (the variables to export). Calls from your computer are free, recorded and never ranked.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"title":"Free models","readOnlyHint":true,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"test_run","title":"Start a test run","description":"Pack a folder and start a test run: it runs once in the same sandbox as scored runs, on the public scenario, and never counts for the leaderboard. Returns the run id, its place in the queue, the package's SHA-256 and label (the git commit by default) and its page; then wait_for_run, run_logs and run_screenshot.","inputSchema